  "Question": "The first AMC \\(8\\) was given in \\(1985\\) and it has been given annually since that time. Samantha turned \\(12\\) years old the year that she took the seventh AMC \\(8.\\) In what year was Samantha born?",
  "Question Type": "text",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\( 1979 \\)",
    "B": "\\( 1980 \\)",
    "C": "\\( 1981 \\)",
    "D": "\\( 1982 \\)",
    "E": "\\( 1983 \\)"
  },
  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "A",
  "Solution": "The first contest is already counted in \\(1985\\), so reaching the seventh contest requires only \\(7-1=6\\) one-year gaps. The seventh AMC \\(8\\) was therefore held in \\(1985+6=1991\\).\n\nSamantha turned \\(12\\) that year, so her birth year was\n\\[\n1991-12=1979.\n\\]\nThe answer is \\(1979\\), choice \\(\\mathrm{A}\\).",
